 R←Test_API_031(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;buff;res
⍝ Runs "Status" with "verbose" on a DETACHED HEAD. Git does not print an "On branch" line then,
⍝ so ⍸ returned an empty vector; ⍬⊃r hands back all of r, and the line that picks the branch name
⍝ out of it used to fail with DOMAIN ERROR.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir
 (rc msg buff)←tempDir G.U.RunGitCommand'checkout -q HEAD~1'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'HEAD detached'⍷∊2⊃tempDir G.U.RunGitCommand'status'

 res←1 G.Status tempDir                 ⍝ Verbose: this is what crashed
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠⍴⍴res
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'HEAD detached'⍷∊res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
